+## 2026-11-02
+- **The demo buttons can no longer wipe a live workspace** ([#66](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/66)).
+  "Reset the demo" and "Load the demo day" are for the demo only. On a live deployment they could still
+  be triggered, and one click (or one request from another website) replaced the uploaded files and
+  deleted saved cases and bulk runs, or put fictional demo payments into the live list. In live mode both
+  are now refused and nothing is changed. Demo mode works as before. Nothing to do.
+
